  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "42",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakoboria Yeremia abasabere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abachiki bonsi b’abasikari, amo na Yohanani, mosinto o Karea, na Yesania, mosinto o Hosaya, na abanto bonsi, korwa omoke goika omonene, bagacha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bagakwana na Yeremia omobani, bakamoteebia, “Nigo togokoboria otoigwe, koranche otosabere intwe abatigari ase Omonene, Nyasae oito. Nigo twarenge abange, korende bono twatigaire abake mono ase omobaro, buna otorooche igaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otosabere ase Omonene, Nyasae oo, atworokie enchera togwenerete kobwatia, na eki togwenerete gokora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia omobani akairaneria, akabateebia, “Naigure amang’ana aino; inche ngochia inde kobasabera ase Omonene, Nyasae oino, buna mwamboririe, na amang’ana ande onsi Omonene arabairanerie, nimbateebie, tinkobabisa nonya nerimo timbateebia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bagateebia Yeremia, “Tiga Omonene abe kirori bw’ekeene na oyo bw’obwegenwa igoro ase tore onye titogochia gokora koreng’ana onsi ay’Omonene, Nyasae oo aratoteebie goetera asore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ayio karabe amaya gose amabe, intwe goika tomoigwere Omonene, Nyasae oito, oyio asare twagotomire; ekiagera toise komoigwera Omonene, Nyasae oito, amang’ana nabe amaya ase tore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene okoiraneria ogosaba kwa Yeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’amatuko ikomi, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia akarangeria Yohanani, mosinto o Karea amo nabachiki bonsi b’abasikari, abwo barenge amo nere, na abanto bonsi korwa omoke goika omonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabateebia, “Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, oyio ase mwantomete erinde ng’ire ogosaba kwaino ase obosio bwaye, agoteeba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komoragenderere komenya ase ense eye, erio inche nimbaagache na tinkobaiyeria inse; nimbasimeke, na tinkobasimora, ekiagera neitirie ase engencho y’amabe aria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa koiroka omorwoti o Babiloni, oyio mwoboete; timomoiroka, ekiagera inche nigo inde amo nainwe, mbatoorie na kobarusia korwa ase okoboko kwaye. Nabo inche Omonene natebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbarorere amaabera, ngere nere abarorere amaabera, erinde abatige mogenderere komenya ase ense yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende inwe komorange komoigwera Omonene, Nyasae oino, na goteeba ng’a timokonyara kogenderera komenya ase ense eye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naende moise goteeba ng’a nigo moganetie kogenda ase ense ya Misiri ase motarore esegi, gose koigwa egetureeri gi’esegi, gose ase motabe nenchara y’okoborwa endagera,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rirorio inwe abatigari b’Abayuda, igwa ring’an’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Onye mwanachire ekiina ng’a mogende Misiri komenya aroro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rirorio emioro eyio moirogete, amo nenchara, nabibatunyane, bibaikeere agwo ase ense ya Misiri, bibaitere aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi abwo bamanoire kogenda Misiri komenya aroro goika baitwe nemioro na enchara, na oborwaire bogoita. Onde tari oranyare gotigara tanyorwa nobobe obwo inche ngochia korenta igoro ase bare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: “Koreng’ana buna narentete endamwamu yane enene igoro ase abanto ba Yerusalemu, naboigo ndayerente igoro ase more, ekero moragende Misiri. Inwe nigo morabe mogokwanwa ekero abanto barabe bakoragereria, na ekero abanto bakobarora nigo barakumie na goichana, naende mobe mogochecherigwa. Timokoirana gocha korora aase aiga naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inwe abatigari b’Abayuda, Omonene obatebirie ng’a timobaisa kogenda Misiri. Manya kegima ng’a inche nabakuureire inwe rituko ria reero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo mweng’ainete ekero mwantomete ase Omonene, Nyasae oino, moganteebia: Genda otosabere ase Omonene, Nyasae oo, na amang’ana ande onsi Omonene, Nyasae oito, aragoteebie, aye gokoyatoteebia goika toyakore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria reero inche nabateebirie amang’ana onsi Omonene antomete ng’a mbateebie, korende inwe mwangire komoigwera Omonene, Nyasae oito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, bono manya na mobe nobomaene ng’a inwe mokwe ase ogoitwa nemioro, na enchara, na oborwaire bogoita, aase agwo mwaganirie kogenda komenya buna abamenyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
